    "detailed_description": "Animals Merge Quest is a relaxing and engaging puzzle game with simple rules that offers hours of enjoyable gameplay. The objective is straightforward: merge animals of the same kind to create a larger animal and earn points. As you progress through the game, you\u2019ll encounter a variety of animal species and increasingly challenging puzzles that require strategic thinking and planning. The soothing visuals and calming sound effects make this game perfect for unwinding after a long day or enjoying a few moments of relaxation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Simple Gameplay Mechanics: Easy to learn and play, making it accessible for all ages.<br />\r\n- Variety of Animals: Discover and merge a wide range of animal species, each with unique designs and animations.<br />\r\n- Progressive Challenges: Face increasingly difficult puzzles as you advance through the levels, ensuring a stimulating experience.<br />\r\n- Beautiful Graphics: Enjoy vibrant, hand-drawn graphics.<br />\r\n- Relaxing Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in a calming musical score and soothing sound effects that enhance the relaxing atmosphere.",
